Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,-1:59:59.60,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}明日の今ごろ
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:01:17.00,Header,,0,0,0,,H010  •  未来進行形（will be ＋ -ing）
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,This time tomorrow, I will be sitting in a meeting room.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.08,0:00:12.98,English,,0,0,0,,At ten I will be attending a lecture, and in the afternoon I will be finishing the new project file.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.98,0:00:19.24,English,,0,0,0,,I have waited a long time for this appointment.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.24,0:00:23.90,English,,0,0,0,,For more than a month, I have been making steady progress.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.90,0:00:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,On the same day my colleague will also be engaged in another task.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.08,0:00:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,After lunch, I will probably move on to the afternoon meeting.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.48,0:00:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,By evening I will nearly complete the report.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.54,0:00:43.80,English,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wonder where I will be a year from now.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.84,0:00:46.22,English,,0,0,0,,Three years?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.72,0:00:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,Life will continue, and I too will be living through many more days.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.72,0:01:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,Placing myself within a schedule gives the day a gentle momentum.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.24,0:01:07.38,English,,0,0,0,,This time tomorrow, I will most likely be sitting at my desk.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.38,0:01:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,But beyond that single moment, another tomorrow is already waiting quietly.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.30,0:01:22.92,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,465)}H010  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.30,0:01:22.92,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}明日の今ごろ
